          "ruleId": "cwe-190",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "reorder 超时用 std::map 数值最小键作恢复点，16 位 SN 回绕时选错 resume：乱序交付 + dropped_ 虚增 + vr_next_ 模意义倒退\n\n已核实：buffer_ 为 std::map<uint16_t,Held>（数值序），ahead() 按 int16_t 模运算接纳乱序包（vr_next_=65530 时 65531 与 2 均可入缓冲），但 on_reorder_timeout 的 resume=buffer_.begin()->first 取数值最小（2 而非序列上更靠前的 65531），交付顺序反转且 skipped=(uint16_t)(2-65530)=8 计入丢包；第二次超时 skipped 虚增约 65528。修复方向：按模序列空间选最靠前键（或以 vr_next_ 为基准扫描）。\n\n**判断理由**：接纳逻辑用模序列、恢复逻辑用数值序，两套排序在 SN 回绕点必然冲突——不是推测性问题，是可构造的确定性错序。\n\n**证据链**：stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:79 ahead() 按 int16_t 模运算判定：vr_next_=65530 时 sn=65531(d=1) 与 sn=2(d=8) 均判为窗内合法乱序包 → stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:78 两包入 buffer_（std::map 数值序：2 排在 65531 前）并启动 t_reorder → stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:134 超时恢复 resume=buffer_.begin()->first 取数值最小键 2，而非模序列上更靠前的 65531 → stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:141 skipped=(uint16_t)(2-65530)=8 计入丢包，vr_next_=2，sn=2 先于 65531 交付——顺序反转\n\n**代码上下文**：\n`stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp`：\n```cpp\nvoid UmRx::on_reorder_timeout(uint32_t now_ms) {\n    // The hole is declared lost: skip every SN below the lowest buffered\n    // one and resume delivery. A partial SDU spanning a lost segment dies.\n    if (buffer_.empty()) return;\n    const uint16_t resume = buffer_.begin()->first;\n    const uint32_t skipped = static_cast<uint16_t>(resume - vr_next_);\n    if (skipped > 0) {\n        dropped_ += skipped;\n        vr_next_ = resume;\n        collecting_ = false;\n        partial_.clear();\n        LOG_WARN(ev::RLC_UM_GAP_SKIP, {{\"skipped\", std::to_string(skipped)}});\n    }\n    deliver_ready();\n    if (!buffer_.empty()) {\n        // More holes remain: re-arm the timer for the next one.\n        timer_running_ = true;\n        timer_deadline_ = now_ms + cfg_.t_reorder_ms;\n    }\n}\n```\n`stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp`：\n```cpp\nvoid UmRx::rx(uint32_t now_ms, const std::vector<uint8_t>& pdu) {\n    if (pdu.size() < 4) return; // [FI][seq:2] + at least 1 payload byte\n    const uint8_t fi = pdu[0] & kUmFiMask;\n    const uint16_t sn = static_cast<uint16_t>(pdu[1] | (pdu[2] << 8));\n\n    if (!seen_.insert(sn).second) {\n        ++duplicates_;\n        return;\n    }\n    if (seen_.size() > 8192) seen_.erase(seen_.begin()); // bound memory\n\n    const int d = ahead(sn);\n    if (d < 0) {\n        if (static_cast<int16_t>(sn - vr_next_) >=\n            static_cast<int>(cfg_.window)) {\n            // Far-ahead jump (link blackout longer than the window): the\n            // hole can never fill — resynchronise at this SN instead of\n            // dropping the whole stream forever.\n            const uint32_t skipped =\n                static_cast<uint16_t>(sn - vr_next_);\n            dropped_ += skipped;\n            vr_next_ = sn;\n            buffer_.clear();\n            collecting_ = false;\n            partial_.clear();\n            timer_running_ = false;\n            LOG_WARN(ev::RLC_UM_GAP_SKIP,\n                     {{\"skipped\", std::to_string(skipped)}});\n            accept_in_order(sn, fi, {pdu.begin() + 3, pdu.end()});\n            deliver_ready();\n            return;\n        }\n```",
            "markdown": "reorder 超时用 std::map 数值最小键作恢复点，16 位 SN 回绕时选错 resume：乱序交付 + dropped_ 虚增 + vr_next_ 模意义倒退\n\n已核实：buffer_ 为 std::map<uint16_t,Held>（数值序），ahead() 按 int16_t 模运算接纳乱序包（vr_next_=65530 时 65531 与 2 均可入缓冲），但 on_reorder_timeout 的 resume=buffer_.begin()->first 取数值最小（2 而非序列上更靠前的 65531），交付顺序反转且 skipped=(uint16_t)(2-65530)=8 计入丢包；第二次超时 skipped 虚增约 65528。修复方向：按模序列空间选最靠前键（或以 vr_next_ 为基准扫描）。\n\n**判断理由**：接纳逻辑用模序列、恢复逻辑用数值序，两套排序在 SN 回绕点必然冲突——不是推测性问题，是可构造的确定性错序。\n\n**证据链**：stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:79 ahead() 按 int16_t 模运算判定：vr_next_=65530 时 sn=65531(d=1) 与 sn=2(d=8) 均判为窗内合法乱序包 → stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:78 两包入 buffer_（std::map 数值序：2 排在 65531 前）并启动 t_reorder → stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:134 超时恢复 resume=buffer_.begin()->first 取数值最小键 2，而非模序列上更靠前的 65531 → stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp:141 skipped=(uint16_t)(2-65530)=8 计入丢包，vr_next_=2，sn=2 先于 65531 交付——顺序反转\n\n**代码上下文**：\n`stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp`：\n```cpp\nvoid UmRx::on_reorder_timeout(uint32_t now_ms) {\n    // The hole is declared lost: skip every SN below the lowest buffered\n    // one and resume delivery. A partial SDU spanning a lost segment dies.\n    if (buffer_.empty()) return;\n    const uint16_t resume = buffer_.begin()->first;\n    const uint32_t skipped = static_cast<uint16_t>(resume - vr_next_);\n    if (skipped > 0) {\n        dropped_ += skipped;\n        vr_next_ = resume;\n        collecting_ = false;\n        partial_.clear();\n        LOG_WARN(ev::RLC_UM_GAP_SKIP, {{\"skipped\", std::to_string(skipped)}});\n    }\n    deliver_ready();\n    if (!buffer_.empty()) {\n        // More holes remain: re-arm the timer for the next one.\n        timer_running_ = true;\n        timer_deadline_ = now_ms + cfg_.t_reorder_ms;\n    }\n}\n```\n`stack/rlc/src/rlc_um.cpp`：\n```cpp\nvoid UmRx::rx(uint32_t now_ms, const std::vector<uint8_t>& pdu) {\n    if (pdu.size() < 4) return; // [FI][seq:2] + at least 1 payload byte\n    const uint8_t fi = pdu[0] & kUmFiMask;\n    const uint16_t sn = static_cast<uint16_t>(pdu[1] | (pdu[2] << 8));\n\n    if (!seen_.insert(sn).second) {\n        ++duplicates_;\n        return;\n    }\n    if (seen_.size() > 8192) seen_.erase(seen_.begin()); // bound memory\n\n    const int d = ahead(sn);\n    if (d < 0) {\n        if (static_cast<int16_t>(sn - vr_next_) >=\n            static_cast<int>(cfg_.window)) {\n            // Far-ahead jump (link blackout longer than the window): the\n            // hole can never fill — resynchronise at this SN instead of\n            // dropping the whole stream forever.\n            const uint32_t skipped =\n                static_cast<uint16_t>(sn - vr_next_);\n            dropped_ += skipped;\n            vr_next_ = sn;\n            buffer_.clear();\n            collecting_ = false;\n            partial_.clear();\n            timer_running_ = false;\n            LOG_WARN(ev::RLC_UM_GAP_SKIP,\n                     {{\"skipped\", std::to_string(skipped)}});\n            accept_in_order(sn, fi, {pdu.begin() + 3, pdu.end()});\n            deliver_ready();\n            return;\n        }\n```"
