            "text": "Xn 切换失败/中止路径不清理 initiated_ho_/pending_xn_ho_，且本 diff 新引入的 in-flight guard 使残留条目永久阻断该 UE 后续切换\n\n已核实：erase 仅存在于成功路径（868/1104/1127）；detach 路径（651-680）只清 tmsi_to_crnti_/flows_；无超时无回滚。HO_COMMAND 经有损空口丢失或 UE 中途 detach 后，bs_node.cpp:1274 `if (initiated_ho_.count(crnti)) return;` 对该 UE 的所有后续 meas report 直接早退——UE 永久钉死在变差的服务小区。修复：超时/失败路径清理 + guard 增加时效判断。\n\n**判断理由**：旧代码无 guard 可自愈（重复发 HO_COMMAND），本 diff 新增的 guard 把「状态泄漏」升级为「活性故障」——缺陷模式是清理缺失，但严重度由新 guard 放大。\n\n**证据链**：stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp:1298 Xn 路径记录 initiated_ho_[crnti]={target,0}，erase 仅在成功路径（868/1104/1127） → stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp:1349 HO_COMMAND 经有损空口发送；丢失后无任何失败路径清理（无超时/无回滚） → stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp:1274 后续 meas report 触发 request_handover，新引入的 guard `if (initiated_ho_.count(crnti)) return;` 对残留条目早退——UE 永久阻断切换\n\n**代码上下文**：\n`stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp`：\n```cpp\nvoid BsNode::request_handover(uint16_t crnti, uint16_t target_cell_id) {\n    auto fit = flows_.find(crnti);\n    if (fit == flows_.end()) return;\n    if (!ho_coordinator_ && !core_separated() && !xn_) return;\n\n    HoContext ctx;\n    ctx.tmsi = tmsi_for_crnti(crnti);\n    ctx.sec_on = fit->second.sec_on;\n    ctx.up_key = fit->second.up_key;\n    ctx.from_cell = config_.cell_id;\n    const auto* ue = nas_bs_.find_ue(ctx.tmsi); // IMSI lookup, best effort\n    if (ue) ctx.imsi = ue->imsi;\n\n    // M22: Xn path (dual-BS demo) — prepare the target over the Xn link,\n    // the HO_COMMAND follows its ACK asynchronously.\n    if (xn_ && !ho_coordinator_ && !core_separated()) {\n        if (initiated_ho_.count(crnti)) {\n            return; // already in flight — a repeated meas report must not\n                    // reset the pending completion\n        }\n        LOG_INFO(ev::HANDOVER_START,\n                 {{\"imsi\", ctx.imsi},\n                  {\"from\", std::to_string(config_.cell_id)},\n                  {\"to\", std::to_string(target_cell_id)}});\n        LOG_INFO(ev::HO_TRIGGERED,\n                 {{\"from_cell\", std::to_string(config_.cell_id)},\n                  {\"to_cell\", std::to_string(target_cell_id)},\n                  {\"via\", \"xn\"}});\n        cn::CnMessage m;\n        m.msg_type = cn::MsgType::XN_HO_PREPARE;\n        cn::put32(m.value, ctx.tmsi);\n        cn::put16(m.value, config_.cell_id);\n```",
            "markdown": "Xn 切换失败/中止路径不清理 initiated_ho_/pending_xn_ho_，且本 diff 新引入的 in-flight guard 使残留条目永久阻断该 UE 后续切换\n\n已核实：erase 仅存在于成功路径（868/1104/1127）；detach 路径（651-680）只清 tmsi_to_crnti_/flows_；无超时无回滚。HO_COMMAND 经有损空口丢失或 UE 中途 detach 后，bs_node.cpp:1274 `if (initiated_ho_.count(crnti)) return;` 对该 UE 的所有后续 meas report 直接早退——UE 永久钉死在变差的服务小区。修复：超时/失败路径清理 + guard 增加时效判断。\n\n**判断理由**：旧代码无 guard 可自愈（重复发 HO_COMMAND），本 diff 新增的 guard 把「状态泄漏」升级为「活性故障」——缺陷模式是清理缺失，但严重度由新 guard 放大。\n\n**证据链**：stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp:1298 Xn 路径记录 initiated_ho_[crnti]={target,0}，erase 仅在成功路径（868/1104/1127） → stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp:1349 HO_COMMAND 经有损空口发送；丢失后无任何失败路径清理（无超时/无回滚） → stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp:1274 后续 meas report 触发 request_handover，新引入的 guard `if (initiated_ho_.count(crnti)) return;` 对残留条目早退——UE 永久阻断切换\n\n**代码上下文**：\n`stack/core/src/bs_node.cpp`：\n```cpp\nvoid BsNode::request_handover(uint16_t crnti, uint16_t target_cell_id) {\n    auto fit = flows_.find(crnti);\n    if (fit == flows_.end()) return;\n    if (!ho_coordinator_ && !core_separated() && !xn_) return;\n\n    HoContext ctx;\n    ctx.tmsi = tmsi_for_crnti(crnti);\n    ctx.sec_on = fit->second.sec_on;\n    ctx.up_key = fit->second.up_key;\n    ctx.from_cell = config_.cell_id;\n    const auto* ue = nas_bs_.find_ue(ctx.tmsi); // IMSI lookup, best effort\n    if (ue) ctx.imsi = ue->imsi;\n\n    // M22: Xn path (dual-BS demo) — prepare the target over the Xn link,\n    // the HO_COMMAND follows its ACK asynchronously.\n    if (xn_ && !ho_coordinator_ && !core_separated()) {\n        if (initiated_ho_.count(crnti)) {\n            return; // already in flight — a repeated meas report must not\n                    // reset the pending completion\n        }\n        LOG_INFO(ev::HANDOVER_START,\n                 {{\"imsi\", ctx.imsi},\n                  {\"from\", std::to_string(config_.cell_id)},\n                  {\"to\", std::to_string(target_cell_id)}});\n        LOG_INFO(ev::HO_TRIGGERED,\n                 {{\"from_cell\", std::to_string(config_.cell_id)},\n                  {\"to_cell\", std::to_string(target_cell_id)},\n                  {\"via\", \"xn\"}});\n        cn::CnMessage m;\n        m.msg_type = cn::MsgType::XN_HO_PREPARE;\n        cn::put32(m.value, ctx.tmsi);\n        cn::put16(m.value, config_.cell_id);\n```"
